flowchart TB
    Client[Client] --> WAF[AWS WAF]
    WAF --> ALB[ALB with TLS]
    ALB --> Services[ECS services]

    Services --> IAM[IAM task roles]
    Services --> Secrets[Secrets Manager]
    Secrets --> KMS[KMS encryption]
    Services --> Logs[CloudWatch Logs]
    Logs --> Trail[CloudTrail]
    Trail --> Detection[GuardDuty + Security Hub]

    Services --> DataSG[Security groups]
    DataSG --> RDS[(Private RDS)]
    DataSG --> Redis[(Private ElastiCache)]
